                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "566aa3cc-1770-34d8-b187-75d35b4ad824",
                        "entry_id": "bdc64a39-7fe8-3ff7-8198-4cc73396c46a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "taxi driver"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "derogatory",
                            "masculine",
                            "person"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d80630d7-2ac6-4395-8ab5-eabde4272604",
                                "sense_id": "566aa3cc-1770-34d8-b187-75d35b4ad824",
                                "text": "Gdy zaczynałem \"cierpiarstwo\", 1 km kosztował 25 zł (taksometr razy pięć). W ciągu 2,5 roku nastąpił 40-krotny wzrost - oto skala inflacji. I to wcale nie koniec.\nTo skutecznie zniechęca do korzystania z naszych usług. Sznury taksówek na każdym postoju przez cały dzień. Nawet stanąć nie ma gdzie. Ręce opadają. Jakże często po iluś godzinach stania zniechęcony zjeżdżałem do domu z pustą kasą. Nawet okres świąteczny nie napędził nam forsy. A cierpiarzy ciągle przybywa.",
                                "translation": "When I started \"cabbiehood\", 1 km cost PLN 25 (taximeter times five). Within 2.5 years there was a 40-fold increase - this is the scale of inflation. And that's not the end.\nThis effectively discourages you from using our services. Lines of taxis at every rank all day long. There's no place to even stand. Hands down. How often, after several hours of standing, discouraged, I came home with an empty cash register. Even the holiday season didn't make us money. And the number of cabbies keeps increasing.",
                                "english": "When I started \"cabbiehood\", 1 km cost PLN 25 (taximeter times five). Within 2.5 years there was a 40-fold increase - this is the scale of inflation. And that's not the end.\nThis effectively discourages you from using our services. Lines of taxis at every rank all day long. There's no place to even stand. Hands down. How often, after several hours of standing, discouraged, I came home with an empty cash register. Even the holiday season didn't make us money. And the number of cabbies keeps increasing."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
